MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1647366069}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b5147389cc8675e4bbb5fba375dd019f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ConversationManager
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 808733396}
  characterName: {fileID: 1346787514}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 879715559}
  continuePrompt: {fileID: 0}
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 384980031}
  luckPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bed5c79ce1ea3eb4aa8b803842ff7cf5, type: 3}
  danePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d3609f2dc305774b8a5fdd7a397bd67, type: 3}
  spikePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a79424b5f4936384987ce9eec9fcbce1, type: 3}
  luckColour: {r: 1, g: 0.75, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  daneColour: {r: 0.3, g: 0.65, b: 1, a: 1}
  spikeColour: {r: 0.9, g: 0.25, b: 0.25, a: 1}
  toBeContinuedPanel: {fileID: 1862394495}
  cameraController: {fileID: 602136862}
  startDelay: 1.5
  typingSpeed: 0.035
  conversation:
  - speakerName: 'LADY LUCK '
    dialogue: General. Colonel.
  - speakerName: GENERAL DANE
    dialogue: Captain.
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: I was just on my way out.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: How did you enter without authorization?
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: Colonel...
  - speakerName: 'GENERAL DANE '
    dialogue: Answer the question, Captain!
  - speakerName: 'LADY LUCK '
    dialogue: The real question is about Bio Novic!
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: What is it? How long has it been kept a secret? How many have lost
      their lives because of it?!
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: You're quite inquisitive. Very well then. General, may I?
  - speakerName: GENERAL DANE
    dialogue: Go ahead.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: The world is dying because of us. For centuries, the planet has suffered
      the consequences of our actions. Pollution. War. Colonization. Segregation.
      You name it.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: Have you ever asked yourself why we strive for world domination?
  - speakerName: 'LADY LUCK '
    dialogue: "\tWhy?"
  - speakerName: GENERAL DANE
    dialogue: "Because the world needs strong leadership! It needs leadership that
      is able to make tough choices.\t"
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: Tough choices?
  - speakerName: GENERAL DANE
    dialogue: To decrease the world population. Not everyone would understand. The
      nations of the world stood against this decision at The World Nations Summit.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: Foolish cretins. Incapable of making sound decisions. So I created
      the Bio Novic. This substance is imbued into essential foods of mass production,
      medicine, beverages and anything consumable.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: The effects of Bio Novic only show up after 5 days. By day 7, the end
      result is death. We will wipe out half of the world's population in a week!
      This is for the good of the world.
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: Surely there's another way to make the world a better place.
  - speakerName: GENERAL DANE
    dialogue: World distribution begins tonight. There is nothing you can do to stop
      it. Furthermore, you do know the consequences of your current actions, right?
  - speakerName: LADY LUCK
    dialogue: General, Colonel. I revere the both of you, but I will not be executed
      until I stop the distribution of Bio Novic.
  - speakerName: COLONEL SPIKE
    dialogue: Do you suppose you can stand against the whole organization by yourself?
      You're not a one man army.
  - speakerName: 'GENERAL DANE '
    dialogue: Farewell, Captain.
